{"about_the_game":"Payasos &amp; Balazos is a 2D action-platformer focused on boss battles, with a strong emphasis on comedy. Help Chicl\u00f3n, a freshly graduated clown, become the star of Circo Domingo and uncover the secrets of the mysterious Laughland Island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArm yourself with your bubblegum blaster, dodge explosive pies, jump across treacherous platforms, and face off against enemies with outrageous wigs and way too much makeup.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfaaKey Features:<br />\r\nIntense boss battles with unique and extravagant personalities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA colorful, exaggerated art style inspired by cartoons and circus aesthetics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenging platforming with arcade-inspired mechanics and a wide variety of enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbsurd humor, funny dialogues, and ridiculously chaotic situations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginal soundtrack blending rock, circus music, and pure chaos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to survive the most dangerous circus in the world?<br />\r\nIt\u2019s time to kick some red-nosed butt!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clownfish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630800/d714887eb70e72082617429854acf5c860911223.jpg"},{"name":"Certified Clown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630800/f19a6a552b0b05bdf56ce068c956c4edb3d2817b.jpg"},{"name":"Stick and Pop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630800/d704f3f5fe26c432f9520febbcadf23b9e1dfe94.jpg"},{"name":"Carpenter Clown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630800/286aebe8da44ee0eb9a2b36c02d9ff3355a0f4f4.jpg"},{"name":"What's Coming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630800/ed2ce9872c9b45fc38c40ec91733549366142154.jpg"},{"name":"Chapulin Tin Tin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi